  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Former IACHR and UN Special Rapporteurs&#x2019; visit to Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project facilitates a joint country visit to Mexico for former Special Rapporteurs for Freedom of Expression from the UN and the Inter-American Court of Human Rights (IACHR). The objective is to follow up on previous joint visits and evaluate any progress and shortcomings of Mexico in the field of freedom of expression and elaborate actionable recommendations for the new government.</narrative>
  </description>
